        "description": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/webguyio/support\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">💬 Ask Question</a> | <a href=\"mailto:webguywork@gmail.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">📧 Email Me</a></p>\n<p>Automate importing your Google Business Profile (formerly Google My Business) reviews into the popular Site Reviews plugin.</p>\n<p>Currently requires the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/site-reviews/\" rel=\"ugc\">Site Reviews</a> plugin and a <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google</a> API key.</p>\n<p>(other plugins and services may be supported in the future)</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p><strong>Automatic</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>From your WordPress Admin, navigate to: <em>Plugins &gt; Add New</em></li>\n<li>Search for: &#8220;Business Reviews Importer&#8221;</li>\n<li>Install it</li>\n<li>Activate it</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Manual</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Download</li>\n<li>Unzip</li>\n<li>Upload to /plugins/ folder</li>\n<li>Activate</li>\n</ul>\n",
